criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Aged 18+,
* Body mass index (BMI)≥ 25;
* Access to a device with SMS and MMS (picture) text and Wi-Fi capabilities (e.g., phone, tablet, computer) and willingness to use the device regularly during the study;
* Willingness to complete four in-person data collection appointments;
* Willing and able to consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Presence of a condition or dietary restriction precluding eating study meals or weight loss (e.g., condition requiring liquid diet, pregnancy);
* Another member of the household participating;
* Planning to move within the next 12 months;
* Unwilling to participate.
